## 🚀 Local Development & Testing

Ensure [Foundry](https://book.getfoundry.sh/getting-started/installation) is installed.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ufodollar/bsc-vault.git
cd bsc-vault
forge install OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts@v5.0.2 --no-commit
forge build
forge test
```

Environment Variables

Create a .env file at the root for deployment:

```env
PRIVATE_KEY=your_wallet_private_key
BSC_RPC_URL=https://bsc-dataseed.binance.org
```

Deployment to BSC Mainnet

⚠️ Important: Ensure the USDT_ADDRESS and USDC_ADDRESS correspond to the BEP-20 versions on BSC, not ERC-20 on Ethereum.

```bash
forge create src/UFOVault.sol:UFOVault \
  --rpc-url $BSC_RPC_URL \
  --private-key $PRIVATE_KEY \
  --constructor-args \
  0x55d398326f99059fF775485246999027B3197955 \
  0x8AC76a51cc950d9822D68b83fE1Ad97B32Cd580d \
  0x9CB5e78F88EFfb5315A7B445aFa64790C8e53eaB \
  <FEE_RECIPIENT_ADDRESS>
```

Extracting ABI

To extract the ABI for frontend integration or DappBay submission:

```bash
forge inspect src/UFOVault.sol:UFOVault abi > UFOVault_ABI.json
```

